 get a salesperson's attention.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Muhammad</span>:  How much are the apples? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Dominic</span>: The large apples are $4 a pound.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mateo</span>: How much are the oranges? <br /><span class=\"strong\">Declan</span>: They're $2.50 a kilo.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bentley</span>: How much are the pears?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Jake</span>:  They are $1.25 each.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking Where Things Are</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking How Much Things Cost</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Excuse me ... Where are the apples? <br />Where are the oranges?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How much are the apples? <br />How much are the pears?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The answer to a <span class=\"italic\"> Where </span>question is a place.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " The answer to <span class=\"italic\"> How much?</span> is a price. It can also include a size and a weight.<br />", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Weights</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Sizes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a kilogram <br />half a kilo <br />grams\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"small <br />medium <br />large\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Expressing Likes and Dislikes", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can express likes and dislikes with different phrases. You can use words like <span class=\"italic\">because</span> , <span class=\"italic\"> also</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> too</span> when you express likes and dislikes. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Expressing Likes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Expressing Dislikes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I like <br />I <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> also</span>  love\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't like \u2026 <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> because</span><br />I hate \u2026 <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> too</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't like fruit because it is sweet.<br /><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Alice</span>: I hate apples! <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> <br />Ben</span>: I hate apples too!<br />I also love oranges!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "supermarket ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a very large food store", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They have apples at the supermarket.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you shop at a supermarket.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "g